intro:
  heading: "Underground Utility Trenching & Pipeline Excavation"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      S. Phaneuf & Associates executes commercial utility trenching and underground pipeline excavation for new commercial buildings, subdivisions, and industrial developments in Massachusetts. Trenching requires careful coordination with Dig Safe guidelines, OSHA shoring compliance, and precise depth control below local frost lines.
    - >
      We excavate trenches for main water connections, sewer lines, gas mains, underground electric conduits, telecommunications, and drainage piping.
    - >
      Following utility line placement, our crews backfill trenches with crushed stone bedding, compact backfill soil in lifts to eliminate settling, and restore asphalt or concrete surfaces flush with existing grades.

